{
  "Version": 1,
  "Name": "Ilgesys",
  "Description": "Dark B minor, tuned a little flat (A4 = 436.3 Hz): a steady B3 with its octave and fifth, under a bass and an inner voice that swing between B and D every 6.9 seconds, each bass note swelling and dying away, while a breathy high melody wanders through a long, dark reverb.",
